# Knowledge pages
error-know-adopt-personal-data = That page may hold personal details, so it can't be adopted.
error-know-adopt-refused = That page reads like an instruction, or it couldn't be checked, so it can't be adopted.
error-know-agent-page-not-found = That reference page isn't in this agent's knowledge folder.
error-know-alias-invalid = That alternative name isn't valid. Use 1 to 200 plain characters, and no more than 16 names.
error-know-bad-pattern = One of the question patterns isn't valid, so it was skipped.
error-know-body-too-large = That page is too long. Shorten it to under 1 MB and try again.
error-know-checkpoint-invalid = The saved progress for this import isn't in the expected form. Start the import again.
error-know-concept-invalid = One knowledge file couldn't be read and was left out. The rest were loaded.
error-know-db-unavailable = The chat history couldn't be read or saved as a page. Try again in a moment.
error-know-description-invalid = The description must be one line of plain text, between 1 and 200 characters.
error-know-entry-invalid = The entry must have some text and be no longer than 20,000 characters.
error-know-entry-not-found = That entry couldn't be found. It may have been removed.
error-know-file-unavailable = The page's file couldn't be saved or opened. Try again.
error-know-header-invalid = The top of this page's file can't be read, probably because it was edited outside ordin.
error-know-history-unavailable = The chat history couldn't be read. Try again in a moment.
error-know-language-unknown = Messages in that language can't be searched yet, so they weren't saved.
error-know-note-empty = A note needs some text.
error-know-note-limit = You have reached the limit of notes here. Remove one before adding another.
error-know-note-not-found = That note couldn't be found. It may already have been replaced or retired.
error-know-note-too-long = That note is too long. Shorten it and try again.
error-know-not-out-of-date = That page is already up to date, so there is nothing to change.
error-know-not-removed = That page hasn't been removed, so there is nothing to bring back.
error-know-no-notes-source = Notes can't be used here because no place to keep them is set up.
error-know-no-pending-update = There is no waiting update for that page.
error-know-okf-header-invalid = The top of that knowledge file can't be read. Check that it is plain, simple text.
error-know-okf-not-utf8 = That knowledge file isn't plain text, so it can't be read.
error-know-okf-reserved = That file is an index or log, not a knowledge page, so it was skipped.
error-know-okf-too-large = That knowledge file is too large to read.
error-know-page-id-invalid = That page name isn't valid. Choose the page again.
error-know-page-limit = This workspace already has 500 pages. Remove one before adding another.
error-know-page-not-found = That page couldn't be found. It may have been removed for good.
error-know-page-removed = That page has been removed, so it can't be changed. Bring it back first.
error-know-profile-mismatch = The knowledge set-up doesn't match this agent, so it couldn't start.
error-know-publish-failed = The page couldn't be published. Try again in a moment.
error-know-query-invalid = That search isn't valid. Check what you typed and try again.
error-know-read-only = That page belongs to another team and can only be read. Make your own copy to change it.
error-know-scope-not-enabled = No chat is switched on for this source here, or the chat system refused. Switch one on and try again.
error-know-sources-too-many = You have reached the limit of 100 sources. Remove one before adding another.
error-know-source-invalid = That source isn't valid. Check its type and where it points, then try again.
error-know-suggestion-not-found = That suggestion couldn't be found, or it has already been accepted.
error-know-suggestion-stale = The page changed after this suggestion was made, so it no longer fits.
error-know-tag-invalid = That tag isn't valid. Use 1 to 64 characters without spaces, and no more than 32 tags.
error-know-team-page-elsewhere = That team page is already held in another place, so it was skipped.
error-know-team-page-invalid = One shared team page broke the page rules and wasn't brought in.
error-know-title-duplicate = Another page in this workspace already has that title. Choose a different one.
error-know-title-invalid = The title must be 1 to 200 plain characters.
error-know-type-invalid = That page type isn't one ordin knows. Choose a type from the list, up to 64 characters.
error-know-unknown-kind = That source isn't one ordin can import from. Only chat history is supported.
error-know-unknown-source = That source couldn't be found, or it isn't chat history.
error-know-workspace-not-found = That workspace couldn't be found. It may be in the Bin.
